# Sleeper: trim the packed tree to what a Hermes build actually needs.
#
# The first three mirror React Native's own exclusion list in
# sdks/hermes-engine/hermes-utils.rb (podspec_source_build_from_local_source_dir),
# so they are already proven safe by the iOS build that uses it. benchmarks/ is
# excluded additionally because no CMakeLists references it.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded, despite being the bulk of the tree: API/hermes_sandbox
# (~85 MB, vendored wasm runtime) because API/CMakeLists.txt adds it unconditionally,
# and unittests/ + test/ because the root CMakeLists references test/static_asserts.
# Dropping any of those breaks CMake configure rather than just shrinking the package.
__tests__/
external/flowtest/
external/esprima/test_fixtures/
benchmarks/
